# Docker build inputs: the *.npy/*.npz/detector.onnx rules above ignore the
# generated dataset, but the Dockerfile COPYs these three specific files, so they
# must be tracked for a fresh clone to build the image (docker-compose.yml). Tiny.
!detector.onnx
!trajectory.npy
!layer2_isam2_results.npz
